    "name_raw": "Extend Spell",
    "definition_type_raw": "Metamagic",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook",
    "definition_raw": "You can make your spells last twice as long.\n\nBenefit: An extended spell lasts twice as long as normal. A spell with a duration of concentration, instantaneous, or permanent is not affected by this feat.\n\nLevel Increase: +1 (an extended spell uses up a spell slot one level higher than the spell’s actual level.)",
